{"type":"message","id":"4802e88c","parentId":"8667ef89","timestamp":"2026-03-23T02:54:56.688Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我直接开始落地：建干净目录、拉最新 OpenClaw、检查 git/GitHub 账号状态，然后我去定位适合修的 bug 点。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0ab7b201c8191a34b36380fc0dc89\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_dNQTQRB9jptKAKubBKBjRkcy|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0ab8076b48191a9b86f449e67788b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /root/.openclaw/workspace/projects && cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/projects && if [ ! -d openclaw-pr ]; then git clone https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw.git openclaw-pr; else echo 'openclaw-pr already exists'; fi && cd openclaw-pr && git remote -v && echo '---' && git branch --show-current && echo '---' && git log -1 --oneline","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":120},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"mkdir -p /root/.openclaw/workspace/projects && cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/projects && if [ ! -d openclaw-pr ]; then git clone https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw.git openclaw-pr; else echo 'openclaw-pr already exists'; fi && cd openclaw-pr && git remote -v && echo '---' && git branch --show-current && echo '---' && git log -1 --oneline\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":120}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ctUM4ALhykp7rMEGMYxGCHXo|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0ab8076c8819182c2698270c7b41b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"git config --global user.name || true; echo '---'; git config --global user.email || true; echo '---'; which gh || true","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":30},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"git config --global user.name || true; echo '---'; git config --global user.email || true; echo '---'; which gh || true\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":30}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_FkIOAm8X8hKzLJ81FOOLrqi3|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169