{"type":"message","id":"f314ed79","parentId":"9ad4aaca","timestamp":"2026-03-23T02:55:45.376Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"干净仓库已经拉好了，默认分支是 `main`，最新提交也拿到了。你的 git 身份本机已配置：`Fan <fzp000@163.com>`。  \n现在差的还是 GitHub 账号接入能力：要么这台机装 `gh` 并登录你的账号，要么我走浏览器用你已登录的 GitHub 网页完成 fork/PR。先看看浏览器侧能不能直接接管你现有登录态。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0abae9e808191af8f5337033f1a09\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0tRbitJuYCByDiX1OeEYavHd|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0abb0c60081919015d72641b10d30","name":"browser","arguments":{"action":"status","target":"host","profile":"chrome"},"partialJson":"{\"action\":\"status\",\"target\":\"host\",\"profile\":\"chrome\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":231,"output":137,"cacheRead":32512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":32880,"cost":{"input":0.0005775,"output":0.002055,"cacheRead":0.008128,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0107605}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774234538028}}
