{"type":"message","id":"dfe19a4d","parentId":"11695794","timestamp":"2026-03-23T02:55:53.056Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]进展：\n\n- 已单独建干净目录：`/root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr`\n- 已拉最新 `openclaw/openclaw`\n- 当前分支：`main`\n- 最新提交已拿到\n- 这台机 git 身份已配置：`Fan <fzp000@163.com>`\n\n现在卡点只有一个：\n\n### 你需要把 GitHub 页面接给我\n我这边检测到 **Chrome Relay 可用，但还没附着标签页**。  \n你现在这样做：\n\n1. 用你自己的 GitHub 账号在 Chrome 打开：\n   - `https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw`\n2. 点一下浏览器里的 **OpenClaw Browser Relay** 工具栏图标\n3. 确认标签页 badge 变成 **ON**\n\n做完你回我一句：\n\n**“已连接 GitHub 标签页”**\n\n我下一步就直接继续：\n- 检查你 GitHub 登录态\n- 用你的账号 fork `openclaw/openclaw`\n- 建分支\n- 定位适合修的 bug\n- 改代码、测最新版本\n- 提 PR\n\n先别让我盲提，我要接管你这个已登录的 GitHub 页面，走你的账号最稳。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0abb3148c81918daafc27edf35950\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":272,"output":290,"cacheRead":32768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":33330,"cost":{"input":0.00068,"output":0.00435,"cacheRead":0.008192,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013222}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774234545447}}
