{"type":"message","id":"40f52440","parentId":"ef4fcc8b","timestamp":"2026-03-23T03:06:48.782Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我先挑一个我们最容易复现、最贴近你当前使用场景的 bug。看列表里 **#52572 Feishu plugin registers all tools twice** 很合适：  \n- 就是 Feishu 相关  \n- 范围聚焦  \n- 容易验证  \n- 修完对我们自己也有价值\n\n我先看 issue 细节，再在代码里搜 Feishu 工具注册链路。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0ae43a7148191bba6b9c3cef9ea47\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ZHI3Wk810HXFCDNn19MrGCMr|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0ae488fb481918ce3c511bc7469b0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"export PATH=\"/root/.local/bin:$PATH\"\ngh issue view 52572 --repo openclaw/openclaw","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":60},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"export PATH=\\\"/root/.local/bin:$PATH\\\"\\ngh issue view 52572 --repo openclaw/openclaw\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":60}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_PG7SfMSpd1TPL0PKqvKc7xdq|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0ae488fc48191a140fceca117b9e8","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr && rg -n \"feishu.*tool|tool.*feishu|register.*tool|tools twice|duplicate.*tool|plugin.*tools\" extensions src packages ui","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":60},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr && rg -n \\\"feishu.*tool|tool.*feishu|register.*tool|tools twice|duplicate.*tool|plugin.*tools\\\" extensions src packages ui\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":60}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":5827,"output":271,"cacheRead":41984,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48082,"cost":{"input":0.0145675,"output":0.004065,"cacheRead":0.010496,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0291285}},"stopReaso