{"type":"message","id":"43927330","parentId":"c6fc1e8a","timestamp":"2026-03-23T03:22:43.225Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]我是在 **OpenClaw 官方 GitHub 仓库的 Issues** 里看到的。\n\n就是这个：\n- **Issue #52572**\n- 标题：**[Bug]: Feishu plugin registers all tools twice**\n\n地址：\nhttps://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/52572\n\n如果你问的是“我是怎么找到它的”——\n我是先用 `gh issue list` 看 OpenClaw 的 bug 列表，再按标题/描述筛到这个问题的。\n\n核心不是我自己瞎总结，是社区已经有人报过，里面明确提到：\n- `openclaw.plugin.json` 已声明 `skills`\n- `index.ts` 的 `registerFull()` 又注册一次\n- 所以 Feishu tools 被重复注册\n\n如果你要，我可以继续把这个 issue 的原文重点给你摘出来，或者顺手把 related issues 一起扒出来。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0b1ff5b2c81918580b3e23fa247cd\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2076,"output":198,"cacheRead":17920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20194,"cost":{"input":0.00519,"output":0.00297,"cacheRead":0.00448,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01264}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774236155201}}
{"type":"message","id":"c4c566b6","parentId":"43927330","timestamp":"2026-03-23T03:22:44.306Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我是在 **OpenClaw 官方 GitHub 仓库的 Issues** 里看到的。\n\n就是这个：\n- **Issue #52572**\n- 标题：**[Bug]: Feishu plugin registers all tools twice**\n\n地址：\nhttps://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/52572\n\n如果你问的是“我是怎么找到它的”——\n我是先用 `gh issue list` 看 OpenClaw 的 bug 列表，再按标题/描述筛到这个问题的。\n\n核心不是我自己瞎总结，是社区已经有人报过，里面明确提到：\n- `openclaw.plugin.json` 已声明 `skills`\n- `index.ts` 的 `registerFull()` 又注册一次\n- 所以 Feishu tools 被重复注册\n\n如果你要，我可以继续把这个 issue 的原文重点给你摘出来，或者顺手把 related issues 一起扒出来。"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774236164306}}
