{"type":"message","id":"c4bb338f","parentId":"c05f7588","timestamp":"2026-03-23T03:37:51.259Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我继续推进。按协作规则，我把活分给 **ling** 和 **weiwei**：一个做执行验证，一个做验收/可视化输出；我这边同步盯 PR / CI / review。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0b582266c8191af64aecc2659a467\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_lO7GaORup8msbysxWaf7iPGI|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0b58ed4588191b8c4c140fa617c00","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:ling:feishu:ling:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713","message":"任务：执行验证 OpenClaw PR 项目相关的可落地动作，并直接回 main。\n\n上下文：当前项目为《OpenClaw自我提升计划》，已有 PR #52597（fix(feishu): avoid double skill registration）。需要你做两件事：\n1）在 `/root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr` 里检查当前 PR 分支本地测试情况，优先执行最相关的测试/检查，目标是确认与 Feishu double registration 修复强相关的本地验证面。优先顺序：\n- 看改动文件\n- 跑最相关命令（例如 check / targeted tests / extension-fast 可对应的本地命令）\n- 输出哪些通过、哪些失败、失败是否像基线问题\n2）顺手检查这个修复是否还需要补 docs / comments / test coverage 建议。\n\n交付要求：直接回 main，格式：\n状态：成功/失败/阻塞\n任务：\n结果：\n原因：\n建议：\n\n注意：别做大范围无关改动，重点是执行验证和给出最相关结论。"},"partialJson":"{\"sessionKey\":\"agent:ling:feishu:ling:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713\",\"message\":\"任务：执行验证 OpenClaw PR 项目相关的可落地动作，并直接回 main。\\n\\n上下文：当前项目为《OpenClaw自我提升计划》，已有 PR #52597（fix(feishu): avoid double skill registration）。需要你做两件事：\\n1）在 `/root/.openclaw/workspace/projects/openclaw-pr` 里检查当前 PR 分支本地测试情况，优先执行最相关的测试/检查，目标是确认与 Feishu double registration 修复强相关的本地验证面。优先顺序：\\n- 看改动文件\\n- 跑最相关命令（例如 check / targeted tests / extension-fast 可对应的本地命令）\\n- 输出哪些通过、哪些失败、失败是否像基线问题\\n2）顺手检查这个修复是否还需要补 docs / comments / test coverage 建议。\\n\\n交付要求：直接回 main，格式：\\n状态：成功/失败/阻塞\\n任务：\\n结果：\\n原因：\\n建议：\\n\\n注意：别做大范围无关改动，重点是执行验证和给出最相关结论。\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_mG9tCJ64OupKm91kafC1paGF|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0b58ed48081919470f8e6644f5ff4","name":"sessions_send","arguments":{"sessionKey":"agent:weiwei:feishu:weiwei:group:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009","message":"任务：为《OpenClaw自我提升计划》产出一个适合后续对外/对内展示的可视化内容方向，并直接回 main。\n\n上下文：这个项目已经从首轮 bug hunting 升级为持续贡献机制。需要一个简洁的可视化表达，帮助后续写文章、汇报或做封面图。你先不要直接生图，先做内容策划。\n\n请输出：\n1）适合这个项目的 3 个封面/信息图方向（例如：持续贡献闭环、PR推进看板、Bug→PR流程）\n2）每个方向的标题文案、副标题文案、核心视觉元素、适合的小红书/公众号风格\n3）建议主推哪一个，为什么\n\n交付要求：直接回 main，格式清晰、可直接拿来生成图。"},"partialJson":"{\"sessionKey\":\"agent:weiwei:feishu:weiwei:group:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009\",\"message\":\"任务：为《OpenClaw自我提升计划》产出一个适合后续对外/对内展示的可视化内容方向，并直接回 main。\\n\\n上下文：这个项目已经从首轮 bug hunting 升级为持续贡献机制。需要一个简洁的可视化表达，帮助后续写文章、汇报或做封面图。你先不要直接生图，先做内容策划。\\n\\n请输出：\\n1）适合这个项目的 3 个封面/信息图方向（例如：持续贡献闭环、PR推进看板、Bug→PR流程）\\n2）每个方向的标题文案、副标题文案、核心视觉元素、适合的小红书/公众号风格\\n3）建议主推哪一个，为什么\\n\\n交付要求：直接回 main，格式清晰、可直接拿来生成图。\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ezvyvAGtZRVcr9GetBo8CKKk|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0b58ed4888191a300bad26c816aaf","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"gh pr view 52597 --repo openclaw/openclaw --json number,title,url,body,comments,reviews,reviewRequests,commits,files,statusCheckRollup,headRefName,baseRefName,author,updatedAt","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":120},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"gh pr view 52597 --repo openclaw/openclaw --json number,title,url,body,comments,reviews,reviewRequests,commits,files,statusCheckRollup,headRefName,baseRefName,author,updatedAt\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":120}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":813,"output":702,"cacheRead":50176,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":51691,"cost":{"input":0.0020325,"output":0.01053,"cacheRead":0.012544,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.025106499999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774237056731}}
{"type":"message","id":"d03d9429","parentId":"c4bb338f","timestamp":"2026-03-23T03:38:21.388Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_lO7GaORup8msbysxWaf7iPGI|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0b58ed4588191b8c4c140fa617c00","toolName":"sessions_send","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"runId\": \"8404d94a-e0b2-49ba-a284-a5f3728542d9\",\n  \"status\": \"timeout\",\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:ling:feishu:ling:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713\"\n}"}],"details":{"runId":"8404d94a-e0b2-49ba-a284-a5f3728542d9","status":"timeout","sessionKey":"agent:ling:feishu:ling:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774237101369}}
{"type":"message","id":"dc13ad70","parentId":"d03d9429","timestamp":"2026-03-23T03:38:51.506Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_mG9tCJ64OupKm91kafC1paGF|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0b58ed48081919470f8e6644f5ff4","toolName":"sessions_send","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"runId\": \"e5a5ab65-e912-4c70-b665-6df5e20665f1\",\n  \"status\": \"timeout\",\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:weiwei:feishu:weiwei:group:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009\"\n}"}],"details":{"runId":"e5a5ab65-e912-4c70-b665-6df5e20665f1","status":"timeout","sessionKey":"agent:weiwei:feishu:weiwei:group:oc_66423c2184d18994a01eccbd30079009"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774237131486}}
{"type":"message","id":"a0e4b4f2","parentId":"dc13ad70","timestamp":"2026-03-23T03:38:52.334Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ezvyvAGtZRVcr9GetBo8CKKk|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0b58ed4888191a300bad26c816aaf","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"author\":{\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzM0MDEz\",\"is_bot\":false,\"login\":\"EronFan\",\"name\":\"范泽鹏\"},\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\nFixes Feishu extension tool duplication by removing the extra static `skills` registration from the plugin manifest.\\n\\nCloses #52572.\\n\\n## Cause\\nThe Feishu extension registered skills in two places:\\n- `extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json` via `\\\"skills\\\": [\\\"./skills\\\"]`\\n- `extensions/feishu/index.ts` inside `registerFull()`\\n\\nThat caused Feishu tools to be registered twice.\\n\\n## Changes\\n- remove the `skills` entry from `extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json`\\n- update generated bundled plugin metadata to match the manifest change\\n\\n`registerFull()` remains intact, so runtime/channel initialization and Feishu-specific setup are unchanged.\\n\\n## Testing\\n- `pnpm test:extension feishu`\\n  - Result: 49 test files passed, 472 tests passed\\n\\n## Notes\\n- I used `--no-verify` for the local commit because this machine's runtime config (`/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json`) makes unrelated repo-wide pre-commit checks fail locally.\\n- The actual Feishu extension test suite passed after the change.\\n\\n## AI usage\\nAI-assisted\\n\",\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOQb6kR8701sGO\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"greptile-apps\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"CONTRIBUTOR\",\"body\":\"<h3>Greptile Summary</h3>\\n\\nThis PR fixes a double skill registration bug in the Feishu extension by removing the static `\\\"skills\\\": [\\\"./skills\\\"]` entry from `extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json` (and the corresponding generated metadata file). All Feishu tools are already registered programmatically through `registerFull()` in `index.ts`, making the static `skills` path redundant.\\n\\n- Removes `\\\"skills\\\": [\\\"./skills\\\"]` from the Feishu plugin manifest — the `skills/` directory contains only `SKILL.md` documentation files, not code, and `registerFull()` is the single source of truth for tool registration.\\n- Updates `bundled-plugin-metadata.generated.ts` to stay in sync with the manifest change.\\n- `registerFull()` and all channel/runtime setup in `index.ts` are untouched, so functionality is fully preserved.\\n- 472 tests passed after the change per the author.\\n\\n<h3>Confidence Score: 5/5</h3>\\n\\n- Safe to merge — the change is a minimal, targeted removal of a duplicate registration entry with no functional side effects.\\n- The fix is a two-line removal that addresses a clearly identified root cause. `registerFull()` remains the sole authoritative registration path, the `skills/` directory only held documentation (`SKILL.md`) files rather than code, and the generated file is correctly kept in sync. The full test suite (472 tests) passed after the change.\\n- No files require special attention.\\n\\n<!-- greptile_other_comments_section -->\\n\\n<sub>Reviews (1): Last reviewed commit: [\\\"fix(feishu): avoid double skill registra...\\\"](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/commit/c002c6c21a5f1d036e3dcfd986b3254f1a44f363) | [Re-trigger Greptile](https://app.greptile.com/api/retrigger?id=25999570)</sub>\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:13:59Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/52597#issuecomment-4107714958\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":false}],\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-03-23T03:11:46Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"fzp000@163.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNzM0MDEz\",\"login\":\"EronFan\",\"name\":\"Fan\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-03-23T03:11:46Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix(feishu): avoid double skill registration\",\"oid\":\"c002c6c21a5f1d036e3dcfd986b3254f1a44f363\"}],\"files\":[{\"path\":\"extensions/feishu/openclaw.plugin.json\",\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"},{\"path\":\"src/plugins/bundled-plugin-metadata.generated.ts\",\"additions\":0,\"deletions\":1,\"changeType\":\"MODIFIED\"}],\"headRefName\":\"fix/feishu-skill-double-registration\",\"number\":52597,\"reviewRequests\":[],\"reviews\":[{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOQb6kR87txNWJ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"NONE\",\"body\":\"\\n### 💡 Codex Review\\n\\nHere are some automated review suggestions for this pull request.\\n\\n**Reviewed commit:** `c002c6c21a`\\n    \\n\\n<details> <summary>ℹ️ About Codex in GitHub</summary>\\n<br/>\\n\\nCodex has been enabled to automatically review pull requests in this repo. Reviews are triggered when you\\n- Open a pull request for review\\n- Mark a draft as ready\\n- Comment \\\"@codex review\\\".\\n\\nIf Codex has suggestions, it will comment; otherwise it will react with 👍.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nWhen you [sign up for Codex through ChatGPT](https://openai.com/codex), Codex can also answer questions or update the PR, like \\\"@codex address that feedback\\\".\\n            \\n</details>\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:14:59Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"c002c6c21a5f1d036e3dcfd986b3254f1a44f363\"}}],\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:25Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/23419807847/job/68122344428\",\"name\":\"auto-response\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:18Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Auto response\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:28Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/23419808873/job/68122347570\",\"name\":\"auto-response\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:20Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Auto response\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:16Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/23419803591/job/68122331370\",\"name\":\"docs-scope\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:07Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:16Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/23419803570/job/68122331218\",\"name\":\"docs-scope\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:07Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Install Smoke\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:20Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/23419803506/job/68122330920\",\"name\":\"label\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:07Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Labeler\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:15Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/23419803596/job/68122331364\",\"name\":\"no-tabs\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:07Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Workflow Sanity\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:06Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SKIPPED\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/23419803506/job/68122331183\",\"name\":\"backfill-pr-labels\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:06Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Labeler\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:25Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/23419803591/job/68122331387\",\"name\":\"secrets\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:07Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-03-23T03:12:26Z