{"type":"message","id":"28c8c8e1","parentId":"88b2d857","timestamp":"2026-03-23T04:04:58.042Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b533ff043b8a4b3c3c9c32732c89\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"sender\": \"范\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-03-23 12:04 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"范 (ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n  \"name\": \"范\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b533ff043b8a4b3c3c9c32732c89]\n范: 你确定一下另外两个agent有没有在实际干活\n\n[System: The content may include mention tags in the form <at user_id=\"...\">name</at>. Treat these as real mentions of Feishu entities (users or bots).]\n[System: If user_id is \"ou_9422b67a82e7df485a188469c448adb7\", that mention refers to you.]"}],"timestamp":1774238698035}}
