{"type":"message","id":"f38343e5","parentId":"8c878bb7","timestamp":"2026-03-23T04:11:56.053Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_vFt7Vn6bFO6J8Yg3K5oxofJ7|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0bd4eb3b08191ac941cafc5206b91","toolName":"sessions_send","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"runId\": \"149141eb-6705-453b-b63e-370eb76fe716\",\n  \"status\": \"timeout\",\n  \"sessionKey\": \"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506\"\n}"}],"details":{"runId":"149141eb-6705-453b-b63e-370eb76fe716","status":"timeout","sessionKey":"agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774239116046}}
{"type":"message","id":"e61b1e69","parentId":"f38343e5","timestamp":"2026-03-23T04:11:56.081Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_JOmPkT068kFODZxjA0juH4ju|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0bd4eb3b88191b603058647630343","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /root/.openclaw/workspace/MEMORY.md."}],"details":{"diff":"    ...\n 65 - 2026-03-23：用户反馈 GitHub 用户名已改为 `EronFan`（主页：`https://github.com/EronFan`）\n 66 \n 67 ## 当前长期项目目标\n 68 - 2026-03-23：用户要求持续推进 OpenClaw 贡献项目，长期寻找 bug、提交改进与修复，并调配 xixi / aoao 协同执行\n+69 - 当前项目正式协作边界：仅 `main + xixi + aoao`；未获用户追加授权前，不默认调度其他 agent 进入该项目执行链路\n 69 - 该项目目标不是刷低质量提交，而是通过高质量 issue / PR / docs fix / walkthrough 改进，帮助用户稳步冲击 OpenClaw contributors 前 20","firstChangedLine":69},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774239116067}}
{"type":"message","id":"e2f0b4d6","parentId":"e61b1e69","timestamp":"2026-03-23T04:12:12.632Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]继续了。\n\n我刚做了 3 件事：\n\n## 1）把项目边界纠正了\n我已经把文档和长期记忆都改了，明确写成：\n\n- 当前项目正式执行成员仅限：\n  - **main**\n  - **xixi**\n  - **aoao**\n- 没有你的追加授权，不默认调度其他 agent\n\n也就是说，这条线我已经收紧，不会再擅自扩人。\n\n---\n\n## 2）只给 xixi / aoao 继续派单\n我已经重新给他们发了下一轮任务：\n\n### xixi\n继续做第二轮高价值线索挖掘，范围收紧到：\n1. docs 与真实行为不一致\n2. `sessions / subagents / message / gateway` 主流程稳定问题\n3. 近期活跃 PR / issue 暴露的小修机会\n\n而且我要求她：\n- 只给 **3 条最值得打的候选**\n- 不准凑数\n\n### aoao\n继续做第二轮复核，重点看：\n1. PR `#52597` 还要不要补强\n2. xixi 已有候选里，哪 2 条最适合最近一两轮直接转：\n   - issue\n   - docs fix\n   - 小 PR\n\n---\n\n## 3）PR #52597 最新状态我又看了一遍\n当前还是这个判断：\n\n### 好消息\n- `extension-fast (feishu)` ✅\n- `checks (node, channels, pnpm test:channels)` ✅\n- `protocol` ✅\n- `build-smoke` ✅\n- `Greptile Review` ✅\n\n### 还没变的地方\n- 暂时**还没有 maintainer 人工 review**\n- `Codex Review` 目前还是入口评论，没看到具体建议\n- 仍有一批大范围 CI 失败：\n  - `check`\n  - `checks (node test 1/2, 2/2)`\n  - `checks (extensions)`\n  - `checks (contracts)`\n  - 多个 `checks-windows`\n\n### 我的判断仍然不变\n这批失败里，**至少有相当一部分不像是这次 Feishu 小修本身引入的**。  \n因为最相关的：\n- Feishu extension fast lane 是绿的\n- channels 也绿了\n\n所以现在最优策略仍然是：\n> 不瞎补，不乱扩大改动面，先持续等更明确的 review / 失败归因。\n\n---\n\n## 当前下一步\n接下来我会继续做两件事：\n1. 收 xixi / aoao 这一轮结果\n2. 继续盯 PR `#52597` 的 review / CI 变化\n\n如果你要一个一句话状态，那就是：\n\n> **项目已继续推进，并且已经纠正回“只用 xixi + aoao 协作”的轨道上。**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0bd90d2b481919b19af186d7a4a92\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":5206,"output":643,"cacheRead":92032,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97881,"cost":{"input":0.013015,"output":0.009645,"cacheRead":0.023008,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.045668}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774239116076}}
