{"type":"message","id":"c5d63e06","parentId":"ee498a4e","timestamp":"2026-03-23T08:16:20.198Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_G2TWFYfOxSN1KHpg0g29R6DT|fc_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0f6d2d6548191b8aeef1684942a07","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"diff --git a/docs/cli/message.md b/docs/cli/message.md\nindex 784fa654db..1f1fcc0c19 100644\n--- a/docs/cli/message.md\n+++ b/docs/cli/message.md\n@@ -8,8 +8,10 @@ title: \"message\"\n \n # `openclaw message`\n \n-Single outbound command for sending messages and channel actions\n-(Discord/Google Chat/Slack/Mattermost (plugin)/Telegram/WhatsApp/Signal/iMessage/Microsoft Teams).\n+Single outbound command for sending messages and channel actions.\n+\n+This page documents the core built-in channel surfaces (Discord/Google Chat/Slack/Mattermost (plugin)/Telegram/WhatsApp/Signal/iMessage/Microsoft Teams).\n+Plugin-provided channels may also expose `openclaw message` support through the same action model; see the corresponding channel/plugin docs for channel-specific targeting rules and capabilities.\n \n ## Usage\n \n@@ -21,7 +23,8 @@ Channel selection:\n \n - `--channel` required if more than one channel is configured.\n - If exactly one channel is configured, it becomes the default.\n-- Values: `whatsapp|telegram|discord|googlechat|slack|mattermost|signal|imessage|msteams` (Mattermost requires plugin)\n+- Core built-in values: `whatsapp|telegram|discord|googlechat|slack|mattermost|signal|imessage|msteams` (Mattermost requires plugin)\n+- Additional plugin-provided channel ids may be available in your installation.\n \n Target formats (`--target`):\n \ndiff --git a/docs/zh-CN/cli/message.md b/docs/zh-CN/cli/message.md\nindex 3eaa638e76..fdf8b2c37c 100644\n--- a/docs/zh-CN/cli/message.md\n+++ b/docs/zh-CN/cli/message.md\n@@ -15,8 +15,10 @@ x-i18n:\n \n # `openclaw message`\n \n-用于发送消息和渠道操作的单一出站命令\n-（Discord/Google Chat/Slack/Mattermost（插件）/Telegram/WhatsApp/Signal/iMessage/MS Teams）。\n+用于发送消息和渠道操作的单一出站命令。\n+\n+本页主要说明核心内置渠道（Discord/Google Chat/Slack/Mattermost（插件）/Telegram/WhatsApp/Signal/iMessage/MS Teams）。\n+如果你的安装中启用了插件提供的渠道，这些渠道也可能通过相同的 action 模型支持 `openclaw message`；具体目标格式和能力请查看对应渠道/插件文档。\n \n ## 用法\n \n@@ -28,7 +30,8 @@ openclaw message <subcommand> [flags]\n \n - 如果配置了多个渠道，则必须指定 `--channel`。\n - 如果只配置了一个渠道，则该渠道为默认值。\n-- 可选值：`whatsapp|telegram|discord|googlechat|slack|mattermost|signal|imessage|msteams`（Mattermost 需要插件）\n+- 核心内置可选值：`whatsapp|telegram|discord|googlechat|slack|mattermost|signal|imessage|msteams`（Mattermost 需要插件）\n+- 你的安装中如果启用了插件渠道，也可能出现额外的 channel id。\n \n 目标格式（`--target`）："}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":27,"aggregated":"diff --git a/docs/cli/message.md b/docs/cli/message.md\nindex 784fa654db..1f1fcc0c19 100644\n--- a/docs/cli/message.md\n+++ b/docs/cli/message.md\n@@ -8,8 +8,10 @@ title: \"message\"\n \n # `openclaw message`\n \n-Single outbound command for sending messages and channel actions\n-(Discord/Google Chat/Slack/Mattermost (plugin)/Telegram/WhatsApp/Signal/iMessage/Microsoft Teams).\n+Single outbound command for sending messages and channel actions.\n+\n+This page documents the core built-in channel surfaces (Discord/Google Chat/Slack/Mattermost (plugin)/Telegram/WhatsApp/Signal/iMessage/Microsoft Teams).\n+Plugin-provided channels may also expose `openclaw message` support through the same action model; see the corresponding channel/plugin docs for channel-specific targeting rules and capabilities.\n \n ## Usage\n \n@@ -21,7 +23,8 @@ Channel selection:\n \n - `--channel` required if more than one channel is configured.\n - If exactly one channel is configured, it becomes the default.\n-- Values: `whatsapp|telegram|discord|googlechat|slack|mattermost|signal|imessage|msteams` (Mattermost requires plugin)\n+- Core built-in values: `whatsapp|telegram|discord|googlechat|slack|mattermost|signal|imessage|msteams` (Mattermost requires plugin)\n+- Additional plugin-provided channel ids may be available in your installation.\n \n Target formats (`--target`):\n \ndiff --git a/docs/zh-CN/cli/message.md b/docs/zh-CN/cli/message.md\nindex 3eaa638e76..fdf8b2c37c 100644\n--- a/docs/zh-CN/cli/message.md\n+++ b/docs/zh-CN/cli/message.md\n@@ -15,8 +15,10 @@ x-i18n:\n \n # `openclaw message`\n \n-用于发送消息和渠道操作的单一出站命令\n-（Discord/Google Chat/Slack/Mattermost（插件）/Telegram/WhatsApp/Signal/iMessage/MS Teams）。\n+用于发送消息和渠道操作的单一出站命令。\n+\n+本页主要说明核心内置渠道（Discord/Google Chat/Slack/Mattermost（插件）/Telegram/WhatsApp/Signal/iMessage/MS Teams）。\n+如果你的安装中启用了插件提供的渠道，这些渠道也可能通过相同的 action 模型支持 `openclaw message`；具体目标格式和能力请查看对应渠道/插件文档。\n \n ## 用法\n \n@@ -28,7 +30,8 @@ openclaw message <subcommand> [flags]\n \n - 如果配置了多个渠道，则必须指定 `--channel`。\n - 如果只配置了一个渠道，则该渠道为默认值。\n-- 可选值：`whatsapp|telegram|discord|googlechat|slack|mattermost|signal|imessage|msteams`（Mattermost 需要插件）\n+- 核心内置可选值：`whatsapp|telegram|discord|googlechat|slack|mattermost|signal|imessage|msteams`（Mattermost 需要插件）\n+- 你的安装中如果启用了插件渠道，也可能出现额外的 channel id。\n \n 目标格式（`--target`）：","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774253780182}}
{"type":"message","id":"bb16c0e7","parentId":"c5d63e06","timestamp":"2026-03-23T08:16:35.697Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]收到，我按这个授权执行。\n\n我已经记住了：\n- **以后默认直接推进**\n- **除非出现比较严重的问题再问你**\n\n而且我刚刚已经直接动手了，不是口头答应。\n\n## 我刚推进的内容\n我已经把 `openclaw message` 这条 docs fix 先在本地分支改了：\n\n改动文件：\n- `projects/openclaw-pr/docs/cli/message.md`\n- `projects/openclaw-pr/docs/zh-CN/cli/message.md`\n\n改动方向很克制，核心是补清这层边界：\n\n### 之前的问题\n文档写得像：\n- 这就是完整支持渠道列表\n\n### 我现在改成了\n明确说明：\n- 这里列的是 **core built-in channels**\n- 如果安装里启用了 **plugin-provided channels**\n- 它们也可能通过同一套 `openclaw message` action model 提供支持\n- 具体要看对应插件 / 渠道文档\n\n### 这样做的好处\n- 不硬写死 Feishu / WeCom 这种扩展渠道\n- 避免将来又因为渠道生态扩展导致文档过时\n- scope 很小，maintainer 更容易收\n\n这个方向比直接把 “Feishu” 硬塞进核心枚举更稳，也更符合 OpenClaw 当前插件生态。\n\n---\n\n## 当前判断\n这次改动是对的，因为它解决的是：\n> **文档把“核心内置渠道”写成了“全部支持渠道”的错觉**\n\n这就是我们当前发现的 docs 偏差本质。\n\n---\n\n## 我接下来会继续做\n下一步我会继续按这个顺序推进：\n\n1. 看这份 docs fix 还要不要补一句更明确的说明\n2. 准备把这条整理成一个小 PR\n3. 继续并行追：\n   - `sessions_send timeout`\n   - `status vs gateway probe` 状态表达差异\n   - `PR #52597` 的 review / CI 变化\n\n后面我就不再每一步都问你了，直接推进。  \n只有遇到 **严重风险 / 需要拍板 / 边界不清** 的时候，我再拉你。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0c5151d58c45418b0169c0f6d768c48191ab1c40ef32e7e4ab\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":924,"output":500,"cacheRead":126080,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":127504,"cost":{"input":0.00231,"output":0.007500000000000001,"cacheRead":0.03152,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.04133}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774253780192}}
